{"name": "email-templates/ship-confirmation.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!--\n  SLST ship-confirmation template (static reference / placeholder map).\n  Runtime rendering uses ship-confirmation.ts \u2014 keep placeholders in sync:\n\n  {{so}} {{customer}} {{carrier}} {{shipped_at}} {{shipped_by}}\n  {{containers}} {{weight}} {{comments}} {{logo_url}} {{cta_url}}\n  {{email_contact}} {{website_url}} {{year}}\n\n  Brand: #D93223 / #B92820 (lib/core/theme.dart SlstColors.brand / brandHover)\n\n  Open assets/email/preview-ship-confirmation.html for a filled browser preview.\n  Open assets/email/mockup-ship-confirmation.png for the design reference.\n-->\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <title>SLST Ship Confirmation \u2014 placeholders</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:24px;background:#F3F5F8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1E293B;\">\n  <h1 style=\"font-size:18px;margin:0 0 12px;\">Ship confirmation placeholders</h1>\n  <p style=\"color:#64748B;font-size:13px;max-width:640px;\">\n    Production HTML is generated by <code>ship-confirmation.ts</code> inside the\n    <code>notify-pm</code> Edge Function when <code>notification_type</code> is\n    <code>ship_confirm</code> or <code>quick_ship</code>. Make receives the HTML in\n    <code>body</code> / <code>html</code> / <code>html_body</code>.\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>SO#</strong> {{so}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Customer</strong> {{customer}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Carrier</strong> {{carrier}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Shipped At</strong> {{shipped_at}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Shipped By</strong> {{shipped_by}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Container(s)</strong> {{containers}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Weight</strong> {{weight}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Comments</strong> {{comments}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Logo URL</strong> {{logo_url}}</li>\n    <li><strong>CTA / tracking URL</strong> {{cta_url}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Email contact</strong> {{email_contact}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Website</strong> {{website_url}}</li>\n    <li><strong>Year</strong> {{year}}</li>\n  </ul>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}